  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Amani Africa supports the implementation of the AU Peace and Security Council Protocol and AU norms on peace, security, governance, and constitutional rule through research-based policy analysis, technical support, and policy dialogue forums. It enhances transparency by analyzing and documenting AU PSC sessions, providing technical briefings, and shaping PSC agendas to improve efficiency. Amani Africa also organizes training workshops on the AU Peace and Security Architecture, creating platforms for diplomats, AU staff, international organizations, CSOs, and media to engage on AU-related issues.</narrative>
  </description>
